# Twenty-seven third-party repositories, cloned as reading material during the
# build. They are 712MB, they are somebody else's work under somebody else's
# licence, and nothing in Brandi depends on them at runtime. What was learned
# from them lives in research/findings/, which IS tracked.
research/benchmarks/

# Generated output. Every one of these is derivable from brand/brand.json by
# running the tool, so committing them would be committing a stale copy.
**/brand/tokens/
**/brand/canvas/
**/brand/assets/
**/brand/brand-book.html
**/brand/brand-book.pdf
**/handover/

node_modules/
.DS_Store
*.log

# Scaffolding written by other tooling that runs in this directory.
build-manifest.json
